m represents the heart of your loyalty program. Its features will attract guests to join your program and, ultimately, visit your restaurant. They emphasize your restaurant's distinctive character in a way that appeals to guests, motivates them to visit more often and to spend more of their dining dollars with you. The core program is the underlying structure of a loyalty program. It defines the program's rewards and how they're earned, redeemed, and expired.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le05ob04re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "43000", "text": "The goal is to create a program that will capture your guests' attention and motivate incremental spending over a long period of time. The core loyalty program you select should enable promotions and accentuate your restaurant. Consider your menu, for example. If a signature item anchors your menu, your promotions should build appeal of that item across a wide range of consumers and/or encourage complimentary product purchases. In contrast, a diverse, dynamic menu may focus promotions on encouraging guests to try various products and to visit for lunch as well as for dinner.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le05ob04re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "79000", "text": "Often added to an established core loyalty program, layered programs give your loyalty program depth and distinctive flair that strengthens your guests' connection to your restaurants. For instance, adding a birthday program encourages guests to celebrate at your restaurant during their birthday month.", "id": 4, "image": "engenn11le05ob04re2img03.jpg"}, {"time": "97000", "text": "Promotions enable you to influence your guests' buying behavior. They provide a key lever to engage guests and prompt visits. Targeted promotions can help generate traffic during slow periods of specific parts of the day, encourage the trial of new menu items, and keep your restaurant on the minds of your guests.", "id": 5, "image": "engenn11le05ob04re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le05ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le05ob04re2img01.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}